  "body": "**Kstuff Lite 1.11 Beta Supports Firmware 1.00-13.60**\r\n\r\nA huge thanks to @sleirsgoevy for the help and creating this project, and to @zecoxao, @flatz, @idlesauce, @buzzer-re, @Al-Azif, @drakmor and everyone else who contributed. Your work and support are greatly appreciated!\r\n\r\n🔹 Changelog\r\nAdded 13.xx Support\r\nAdded 1.xx/2.xx Support @drakmor \r\nAdded Fpkg Upto 11.40 @drakmor \r\nPerformance tuning @drakmor\r\nPS4 media app support @drakmor\r\nFixed Fpkg For 11.60 @ArkSama \r\nFixed int3 For 13.xx @idlesauce \r\nAdded Misc Kit Stuff\r\n\r\n** @drakmor put alot of work into fpkg so make sure you thank him.. **\r\n\r\n📂 Original Source:\r\n[github.com/sleirsgoevy/ps4jb-payloads/tree/bd-jb](https://github.com/sleirsgoevy/ps4jb-payloads/tree/bd-jb)",
